# The oracle's own compiled extensions: its library directory, and the
# harness's instrument directory, where librxunixsysc.so links to its
# librxunixsys.so. This crate answers rxunixsys with a library of its own, so
# this program names the link to reach the shared-library path on both sides.
# The spawned side is given these directories as well; the in-process side
# reads them from here because the process loader cannot be told later.
LD_LIBRARY_PATH={oraclelib}:{instruments}
